{
  "__comment": [
    "Block type registry — the hot-path file. Loaded once at boot and cached.",
    "Each key is the PERMANENT save-file string. Runtime IDs are session-only",
    "integers mapped from these keys at load time — never store integers in saves.",
    "See data/terrain/NAMING_RULES.md for key format conventions.",
    "See data/terrain/block_resources.json for drop/yield/depth data.",
    "",
    "Surface colour palette note:",
    "  grass_NN (×16) and dirt_NN (×4) use hex_color as the SUMMER baseline only.",
    "  At runtime the renderer looks up the active colour from:",
    "    data/terrain/surface_palettes.json → [variant_name][season]",
    "  If the palette file is absent or the key is missing, hex_color is used as fallback.",
    "  Block IDs never change between seasons — only the rendered colour swaps."
  ],

  "block_types": {

    "__comment_special": "Special / reserved blocks",
    "base:terrain:void":           { "kind": "void",       "hex_color": "#00000000", "hardness":  0 },
    "base:terrain:bedrock":        { "kind": "bedrock",    "hex_color": "#111116",   "hardness": -1 },

    "__comment_rock": "Igneous, sedimentary, and metamorphic stone layers",
    "base:terrain:rock:granite":   { "kind": "rock",       "hex_color": "#4B5358",   "hardness":  3 },
    "base:terrain:rock:basalt":    { "kind": "rock",       "hex_color": "#2E2E2E",   "hardness":  4 },
    "base:terrain:rock:limestone": { "kind": "rock",       "hex_color": "#C2B89A",   "hardness":  2 },
    "base:terrain:rock:marble":    { "kind": "rock",       "hex_color": "#E8E8E4",   "hardness":  3 },
    "__comment_obsidian": "Volcanic glass — rare deep pockets near the magma floor. Static worldgen placement for now; intended to become a dynamic lava+water formation product when the magma system is added.",
